Thandeka and Sipho run a building materials business in Gweru. Their partnership agreement provides for:

- interest on capital at 8% per annum;
- a salary for Thandeka of US\$7,500 per annum;
- profits and losses shared equally.

At 1 January 2025 their capital accounts were Thandeka US\$42,000 and Sipho US\$26,000. On 1 October 2025 Sipho paid a further US\$8,000 of capital into the business bank account. Their current accounts at 1 January 2025 had credit balances of Thandeka US\$1,680 and Sipho US\$940.

The profit for the year ended 31 December 2025 was US\$39,280. Drawings were Thandeka US\$18,450 and Sipho US\$24,300.
